margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center">- and -</p>
 <p class="SCCLsocParty" align="center" style="text-align:center">Canadian Civil Liberties Association, Canadian Human Rights Commission, Center for Research-Action on Race Relations, National Council of Canadian Muslims, Canadian Muslim Lawyers Association and South Asian Legal Clinic of Ontario</p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center">Interveners</p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center">&nbsp;</p>
